      "content": "Taking St. John's wort with birth control pills is risky because it can interfere with the pills' effectiveness, potentially leading to unintended pregnancy. These two substances should generally not be used together without strict medical supervision, as St. John's wort accelerates the metabolism of many medications. I strongly recommend speaking with your doctor before combining them to find a safe and effective alternative for your mood.",
