      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but my doctor always just tells me to take prescription stuff and i'd really rather avoid that if i can. i've read online that if i just take a slightly lower dose of the st johns wort it might not affect the pill as much? do u think that would be a safer way to do it?",
